message: >-
  If you use this software, the pose datasets or the demo, please cite the paper below (DOI 10.1117/12.3096312),
  plus the pose backend you used and the source dataset of every pose subset you use.
title: "WholeBodyPose"
abstract: >-
  Unified whole-body (COCO-WholeBody, 133 keypoints) pose estimation with RTMPose, ViTPose and MediaPipe,
  with video processing, temporal filtering and visualization for sign language recognition.
